途としては、\n・Xでの使用（おはようポスト、宣伝等）\n・YouTubeでの使用(サムネイル等)\n※もし描いていただけた場合にはYouTubeの配信で、ご紹介をする可能性があります。\nご了承ください！\n\n甘冷らくと様の思うがまま、好きな様に描いて頂けたら嬉しいです♡\n 特徴としては、タレ目つり眉、ふわふわ癖っ毛のみつあみ、八重歯、です！リスナーさんからは元気で明るくてちょっと不憫なところをよく褒めていただきます。\n\nskebでのリクエスト依頼が不慣れなもので、至らぬ点がございましたら誠に申し訳ございません。\nご検討の程よろしくお願いいたします！\n\n==========\n\nhttps://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1PXJhN0xPLf1-vuTJUxRwBkv4LyMlCcPW", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@amabierakuto/works/11", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/d7fcef4f/uploads/origins/5b0a7b9e-940a-441f-ab3f-c771b94643d2?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=b0f6d21dd017b5a48076a514d2e451ea", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/d7fcef4f/uploads/origins/5b0a7b9e-940a-441f-ab3f-c771b94643d2?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=b0f6d21dd017b5a48076a514d2e451ea, https://si.imgix.net/d7fcef4f/uploads/origins/5b0a7b9e-940a-441f-ab3f-c771b94643d2?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=d6400a5f12bab952153c68936e5cf138 2x, https://si.imgix.net/d7fcef4f/uploads/origins/5b0a7b9e-940a-441f-ab3f-c771b94643d2?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=22ff2651025b0a69a115428f70e0c2e8 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": false, "body": "本当に良いのだろうか、、と言う気持ちですがXのポストを見てリクエストさせて頂きます。\n個人Vtuberの山葵つんと申します。\nみゆちゃんと仲良くさせていただいており、らくとさんのキラキラで可愛いイラストも拝見しています。\n\n【依頼内容】\n私を描いていただきたいです。\n資料にある衣装で、髪形や衣装の袖の有り無しは描きやすいもので描いていただきたいです。\n構図もお任せでお願いします。\n\n【使用用途】\n収益化済のyoutubeのサムネイルやヘッダーなど配信活動や配信告知に使用させていただきたいです。\nまた、顔周りのパーツが見切れておらず、背景透過のデータを頂けたら嬉しいです。\nご検討よろしくお願いいたします。\n\nhttps://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1MHVQtAC2U3MTUVwSOdOH_12iqOxkXhC8?usp=sharing\n\nhttps://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1MHVQtAC2U3MTUVwSOdOH_12iqOxkXhC8?usp=sharing", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@amabierakuto/works/10", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/42d2c981/uploads/origins/a62883ca-4da1-4479-859e-603d711810dd?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=4c209c050def5181a52544e4632e2e40", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/42d2c981/uploads/origins/a62883ca-4da1-4479-859e-603d711810dd?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=4c209c050def5181a52544e4632e2e40, https://si.imgix.net/42d2c981/uploads/origins/a62883ca-4da1-4479-859e-603d711810dd?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=7edf7a6f7e0b94c6f8024c8d5e8f9bf5 2x, https://si.imgix.net/42d2c981/uploads/origins/a62883ca-4da1-4479-859e-603d711810dd?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=437a2e88dad6b1a5e0fddbe0dd3f4070 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": false, "body": "I want Mumu-chan to have an adult-like atmosphere.\nThe image is that of a mature, cool, older woman.\nThe main color should be blue.\nI want her to wear a military uniform and a skirt.\nI would appreciate it if you could make her dress in a cool and cute way.\nI would like her to wear her hair waist length and have a mature look. I will leave the hairstyle up to you.", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@amabierakuto/works/9", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/4858e739/uploads/origins/8adb52a5-0cde-44e0-89d8-b0442f46d8b9?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=513dfeb159f6fa14907311111c5b77aa", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/4858e739/uploads/origins/8adb52a5-0cde-44e0-89d8-b0442f46d8b9?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=513dfeb159f6fa14907311111c5b77aa, https://si.imgix.net/4858e739/uploads/origins/8adb52a5-0cde-44e0-89d8-b0442f46d8b9?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=7029fbabcd1d674a2a9a3117baf69a4e 2x, https://si.imgix.net/4858e739/uploads/origins/8adb52a5-0cde-44e0-89d8-b0442f46d8b9?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=c34d9da734d751bc01335c072e3b1a80 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": false, "body": "Thank you so much for all your hard work last time! It was beautiful!\n\nI would like to have a character drawn in a pose like the one in the reference. Also, could you please make it full bodied?\n\nThank you very much!\n\nhttps://imgur.com/a/KhxGgsT", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@amabierakuto/works/8", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/21210a6d/uploads/origins/fd742dc7-118b-4881-95b1-0886ca70f04a?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=dbfeefe6b28cc16bba689455155f4f60", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/21210a6d/uploads/origins/fd742dc7-118b-4881-95b1-0886ca70f04a?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=dbfeefe6b28cc16bba689455155f4f60, https://si.imgix.net/21210a6d/uploads/origins/fd742dc7-118b-4881-95b1-0886ca70f04a?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=ef6bd2c439f96c38615c37b24dfddf8a 2x, https://si.imgix.net/21210a6d/uploads/origins/fd742dc7-118b-4881-95b1-0886ca70f04a?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=7a96a3783c8c17138dbb3a7a03d88fc7 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": false, "body": "Thank you very much for your help.\nWe are looking for the extraordinarily cute Itadakusa-san. I will leave everything to you, including the design and composition. If it is possible within the price, I would like to have a facial expression of disdain with eyes as if looking at garbage. Thank you very much.", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@amabierakuto/works/7", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/57649118/uploads/origins/2cf9add0-2cd5-4f33-97ef-9a27a36ef05f?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=6689e29d6ced91312275ccdd4c18d0fa", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/57649118/uploads/origins/2cf9add0-2cd5-4f33-97ef-9a27a36ef05f?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=